    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Trojan Support Vehicle",
    "summary": "In your Command phase, pick one friendly ASTRA MILITARUM VEHICLE model 3\" or less from this model. It recovers as many as D3 lost wounds. Until your next Command phase starts, it also re-rolls Hit rolls of 1 for its attacks. In a single turn, no VEHICLE model can be picked for this ability as well as for the Regimental Enginseer's Omnissiah’s Blessing ability, and no model can be picked for this ability more than once per Command phase.",
